  "description": "Unofficial .NET client for the Ondo Perps Spot API. Typed REST and WebSocket access to Spot market data, Spot trading (limit/market orders, amend, batch, cancel), Spot balances and transfers, deposits, withdrawals, address book and API key management, with built-in HMAC request signing, pagination, rate limiting and error mapping. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Ondo.",
